      "description": "Thirty time columns anchored to now, eight fixed equal rows, visible axis bounds, observed min/max and gaps. HEAT spans 20–110°C; CPU and RAM span 0–100% with the same linear full-palette gradient.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-meter\"><i style=\"background:#FF707333\"></i><i style=\"background:#FF835529\"></i><i style=\"background:#FFB000\"></i><i style=\"background:#FFE3A3\"></i><i style=\"background:#DCE6EE\"></i><i style=\"background:#A5C1DB\"></i><i style=\"background:#FF707333\"></i><i style=\"background:#FF835529\"></i><i style=\"background:#FFB000\"></i><i style=\"background:#FFE3A3\"></i><i style=\"background:#DCE6EE\"></i><i style=\"background:#A5C1DB\"></i><i style=\"background:#FF707333\"></i><i style=\"background:#FF835529\"></i><i style=\"background:#FFB000\"></i><i style=\"background:#FFE3A3\"></i><i style=\"background:#DCE6EE\"></i><i style=\"background:#A5C1DB\"></i><i style=\"background:#FF707333\"></i><i style=\"background:#FF835529\"></i><i style=\"background:#FFB000\"></i><i style=\"background:#FFE3A3\"></i><i style=\"background:#DCE6EE\"></i><i style=\"background:#A5C1DB\"></i><i style=\"background:#FF707333\"></i><i style=\"background:#FF835529\"></i><i style=\"background:#FFB000\"></i><i style=\"background:#FFE3A3\"></i><i style=\"background:#DCE6EE\"></i><i style=\"background:#A5C1DB\"></i></div>",
